OL,3,GNEWSA'Helping people with music is my
OL,4,Amission'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA singer who used music to cope with
OL,7,Fchildhood grief said she has made it
OL,8,Fher mission in life to help other
OL,9,Fpeople's wellbeing with the medium.
OL,11,FLady Nade, from Bristol, turned to
OL,12,Fsinging and songwriting at the age of
OL,13,F10 after her grandmother passed away.
OL,14,FAs a teenager, she embarked on a career
OL,15,Fin the field through free music
OL,16,Fworkshops.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
