OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Helping people with music is my
OL,4,Amission'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow working as a music facilitator, she
OL,7,Fsaid her work had allowed her to build
OL,8,F"incredible connections" with
OL,9,Fschoolchildren, prisoners, hospital
OL,10,Fpatients, hospice patients and bereaved
OL,11,Ffamilies.
OL,13,F"I have this sort of vision and mission
OL,14,Fthat music should be accessible to all.
OL,15,FI want to be part of that advocacy
OL,16,Fbecause music empowers people," Lady
OL,17,FNade said.
